OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fclear and dry in the east, with any
OL,7,Fwintry showers gradually fading in the
OL,8,Fwest. Breezy to start but winds easing
OL,9,Fthrough the night. Turning cold
OL,10,Funderneath the clear skies with icy
OL,11,Fstretches and a widespread frost.
OL,12,FMinimum Temperature -3C.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FA cold and frosty start with
OL,15,Ficy stretches in places. Otherwise a
OL,16,Fdry and sunny day with lighter winds
OL,17,Fthan of late. Cloud gradually building
OL,18,Fduring the evening. Maximum
OL,19,FTemperature 9C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page BWeatherCReg Sport FNat Radio
