OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,6,FRemaining cloudy and changeable from
OL,7,FSaturday, as bands of rain and showers
OL,8,Fpush eastwards across the region.
OL,9,FBreezy at times. Feeling less cold as
OL,10,Ftemperatures return to near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
